      "mapping_note": "Each id is MX_<nnn>_<Group>_<Detail>; the group prefix names the layer, and each prefix maps to exactly one recovered MoxieCustomizationType. An id whose prefix does not map with confidence goes to `unmapped`, never guessed.",
